      "Key Contexts: pressure, interviews, leadership, apologies, conflict repair, difficult questions, clinical-style conversations, supervision, negotiation, presentations, teaching, boundary-setting, feedback, emotionally loaded replies and moments where you are tempted to overtalk Misuse Cringe Risk: Cringey when the pause is too staged, accompanied by intense eye contact, followed by a grand line, or repeated until it feels like a tactic",
