        "workplace disagreement where the real constraint is not yet explicit;",
        "personal conversations where someone seems reluctant but is not naming why;",
        "coaching or leadership moments where defensiveness might be protecting a real concern;",
        "repair conversations where the other person has lost trust in the process.",
        "the other person has already given a clear boundary and does not want to explain;",
        "the situation involves danger, abuse, coercion, or a need for immediate safety action;",
