          'Client/service: "When requirements change after sign-off, the timeline and cost change too. Please send changes in writing. If the scope changes, I will send an updated estimate before continuing."',
          'High-pressure concise version: "I can do this if the scope stays fixed. If the scope changes again today, I will need to pause and replan."',
          'Softer invitation: "Can I name the pattern I am seeing and the request I need to make?"',
